  "reading": {
    "zh": "先是共享的格式化与打开 VFS 辅助，再是文件系统子命令（镜像生命周期、目录、整文件操作、检查、管理），随后是卷/驱动器/向量/日志数据子命令，最后是注册全部命令的解析器、分发入口与 python -m 钩子。",
    "en": "Shared formatting and VFS-opening helpers, then the filesystem subcommands (image lifecycle, directories, whole-file operations, inspection, administration), then the volume/drive/vector/log data subcommands, and finally the parser that registers them all, the dispatch entry point and the python -m hook."
  },
